{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["King of Fighters: Another Day","The four episodes are set in Southtown, the imaginary city well known to all fans as the stage of numerous death matches throughout the KOF series. Many past heroes of the saga make their appearance here, and the four plots intertwine to create a large-scale drama, that is also linked to the story of KOF Maximum Impact 2."],"ja":["ザ・キング・オブ・ファイターズ アナザーデイ",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-825","ids":{"shikimori":825,"mal":825,"anilist":825,"kodik":"serial-23842"},"kodikIds":["serial-22715","serial-22766","serial-23842"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-22715":"2020-02-12T12:07:18Z","serial-22766":"2020-02-13T16:36:09Z","serial-23842":"2020-03-18T13:45:22Z"},"title":"Король бойцов: На другой день","originalTitle":"The King of Fighters: Another Day","alt":"ザ・キング・オブ・ファイターズ アナザーデイ","description":"Действие всех четырёх эпизодов разворачивается в Сауттауне — вымышленном городе, хорошо знакомом всем поклонникам серии KOF как арене бесчисленных смертельных поединков на протяжении многих игр франшизы. Здесь появляется множество героев прошлого, а четыре сюжетные линии переплетаются, создавая масштабную драму, которая к тому же связана с историей KOF Maximum Impact 2.","year":2005,"type":"ONA","genres":["Приключения","Драма"],"rating":6.27,"popularity":2540,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/825/e8278e860d360aad3d299e2e61a7ed1b.jpeg","width":250,"height":380},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/35816f1d76805e0694e852cc6daa54166c0fcb2b.jpg","width":854,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-820","dubId":"820","label":"animereactor","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-